      "MsgSerial" : 20761,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'll go ahead to escort Joseph.\r\nYou cover the rear, we'll meet at Ark.",
        "Jp" : "俺はジョゼフの護衛として先行する\r\nおまえは後方を頼む、アークで合流しよう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20762,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That aside— \r\nI have no dissent regarding \r\nthe investigation itself, \r\nbut reports, meetings, and deliberations— \r\nI wonder when we'll reach a conclusion.",
        "Jp" : "それにしても――\r\n調査自体には異論はないが\r\n報告だ、会議だ、検討だ――\r\n結論はいつになるのだろうな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20763,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Furthermore, it appears that Klaus,\r\nwho joined the first investigation,\r\nwill be left behind. I cannot understand \r\nJoseph's true motives, much less Diamantes'.",
        "Jp" : "しかも、最初の調査隊に参加した\r\nクラウスは置いてくらしい\r\nディアマンテスどころか\r\nジョゼフの真意も俺にはわからん"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163171,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
