      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The meeting is still ongoing,\r\nbut there are calls to urgently investigate \r\nthe second Ark.",
        "Jp" : "会議はまだ続いているが\r\n取り急ぎ第二のアークを調べるべきだという\r\n声があがってな"
