      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The first Ark brought forth Zuhl, \r\nand the way the Orcs allied with him,\r\nthe conflict changed significantly.",
        "Jp" : "第一のアークとともにズールが現れ\r\n奴と手を組んだオークどもの戦いぶりが変わった\r\nアークがもたらした大きな変化だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163150,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, what exactly are the changes \r\nbrought by the second Ark―― \r\nWe will understand by examining it closely.",
        "Jp" : "では、第二のアークがもたらす変化は\r\nいったいどのようなものか――\r\nアークを調べればすぐにわかるだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163151,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This time, I shall accompany you. \r\nI must see the real thing with my own eyes.\r\nI have asked Leo to escort me,\r\nbut anything could happen within the Ark.",
        "Jp" : "今回はわたしも行く\r\nどうしてもこの目で実物を見ておきたいのだ\r\n護衛はレオに頼んだが、道中はともかく\r\nアーク内は何が起こるかわからん"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163152,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You will come too, won't you? \r\nLet us meet at the Ark.",
